WEBVTT

01:36.310 --> 01:41.030
[The Journey of Legend]

01:41.430 --> 01:43.910
[Episode 16]

01:47.280 --> 01:48.880
You're really calculating.

01:49.430 --> 01:51.000
Have you ever calculated

01:52.509 --> 01:53.820
when you'll die?

02:02.590 --> 02:04.790
I'm not interested in arguing with you.

02:09.120 --> 02:10.520
If you want a quick death,

02:11.190 --> 02:13.150
tell me what I want to know.

02:16.430 --> 02:18.079
I don't have time for this.

02:20.079 --> 02:21.240
You're a dying man.

02:22.360 --> 02:23.190
Be smart

02:23.630 --> 02:25.560
and give me the Hero Command Token.

02:25.840 --> 02:28.040
I'll consider giving you a quick death.

02:29.430 --> 02:30.630
Do you dare to kill me?

03:00.470 --> 03:01.080
Xueyu.

03:01.710 --> 03:02.360
Yiren.

03:03.130 --> 03:04.860
Where are Mr. Qu and the others?

03:06.590 --> 03:07.360
Xueyu.

03:07.910 --> 03:10.980
Qu Hanshan really is the Sword King.

03:12.930 --> 03:14.010
Qiushui was…

03:14.040 --> 03:14.600
Xiaoyi.

03:19.710 --> 03:20.400
Qiushui…

03:24.120 --> 03:25.450
What exactly happened?

03:26.430 --> 03:28.030
Qiushui risked his life

03:28.910 --> 03:30.770
to prevent us from being deceived

03:31.120 --> 03:32.400
by Qu Hanshan

03:34.710 --> 03:35.910
and was struck down.

03:39.030 --> 03:40.290
How could this happen?

03:41.870 --> 03:42.870
Where is Qiushui?

03:44.079 --> 03:44.940
Where is he now?

03:46.840 --> 03:47.630
Xueyu.

03:49.960 --> 03:50.910
I must find him.

03:51.240 --> 03:52.000
I can surely heal him.

03:52.000 --> 03:53.460
Xueyu, don't be reckless.

03:53.470 --> 03:55.000
Qiushui kept telling us

03:55.000 --> 03:56.920
to return to the Sword Manor
as soon as possible.

03:56.920 --> 03:58.920
We cannot let his efforts be in vain.

04:01.590 --> 04:02.390
That's right.

04:02.800 --> 04:04.680
Now is not the time for grief.

04:05.030 --> 04:08.240
Kaiyan has gone ahead to scout

04:08.560 --> 04:10.240
according to Qiushui's tactical map.

04:10.240 --> 04:11.280
Once he returns,

04:11.560 --> 04:13.020
we'll leave immediately.

04:13.470 --> 04:14.470
Yiren is right.

04:14.780 --> 04:15.720
We'll leave very soon.

04:15.720 --> 04:17.649
We can't delay any longer.

04:18.720 --> 04:19.850
What about Qiushui?

04:24.750 --> 04:25.870
Is Kaiyan back?

04:26.820 --> 04:27.380
No,

04:28.870 --> 04:30.130
it's a group of people.

04:34.480 --> 04:36.120
Qu Hanshan's men are coming after us!

04:36.120 --> 04:37.380
Everyone, be careful!

05:00.270 --> 05:01.930
Still trying to play the hero.

05:02.310 --> 05:03.570
The Hero Command Token

05:04.040 --> 05:06.300
has nothing to do with you, Xiao Qiushui.

05:07.040 --> 05:08.110
Why cling to it?

05:08.800 --> 05:10.730
The token has nothing to do with me,

05:11.240 --> 05:12.770
but you won't get it either.

05:13.270 --> 05:14.870
Quite stubborn, aren't you?

05:16.190 --> 05:18.320
Seems you haven't starved enough yet.

05:20.040 --> 05:22.770
I already accepted death
in Top Fairness Forest.

05:23.120 --> 05:23.920
Why am I…

05:24.640 --> 05:26.880
Now I need to stall him

05:27.050 --> 05:29.160
to buy Yiren time
to return to the Huanhua Sect,

05:29.160 --> 05:31.290
which might change how the story ends.

05:41.190 --> 05:43.320
If you're afraid I'll starve to death,

05:43.800 --> 05:45.930
you should unseal my acupoints first.

05:47.430 --> 05:48.720
Giving in so quickly?

05:49.190 --> 05:50.520
I doubt you're sincere.

05:50.720 --> 05:51.980
Don't believe me then.

05:52.360 --> 05:55.600
The Hero Command Token
is useless to me anyway.

06:19.950 --> 06:21.880
Is everyone alright? Anyone hurt?

06:24.510 --> 06:25.270
Xiaoyi.

06:27.920 --> 06:28.580
How are you?

06:29.120 --> 06:29.850
Are you okay?

06:31.190 --> 06:31.920
How are you?

06:32.310 --> 06:33.240
I'm fine, Xueyu.

06:33.680 --> 06:34.970
My meridians aren't damaged.

06:34.970 --> 06:35.560
Good.

06:36.159 --> 06:39.040
Qu Hanshan actually set up an ambush here.

06:39.390 --> 06:41.440
There must be more pursuers.

06:41.880 --> 06:43.480
We shouldn't stay here long.

06:53.270 --> 06:55.070
Yiren, Xueyu,

06:55.920 --> 06:56.630
bad news.

06:57.310 --> 06:57.909
What is it?

06:59.270 --> 07:02.190
The Power Gang discovered
that Qiushui stole the map,

07:02.190 --> 07:03.920
and they changed the ambush location.

07:03.920 --> 07:05.750
The shortest route for reinforcements

07:05.750 --> 07:07.480
is now blocked by fallen rocks.

07:07.510 --> 07:09.640
Several of our men were killed by them.

07:09.830 --> 07:11.750
Blockade ahead, pursuers behind.

07:11.750 --> 07:12.750
What should we do?

07:13.430 --> 07:14.480
In that case,

07:14.920 --> 07:15.950
we have to make a detour

07:15.950 --> 07:17.150
to the Diancang Sect.

07:17.360 --> 07:19.930
Father has long-standing ties
with the Diancang Sect.

07:19.930 --> 07:21.930
Besides, if we head northwest,

07:22.240 --> 07:24.430
we can evade the pursuers
sent by Qu Hanshan.

07:24.430 --> 07:25.890
I'm sorry for the trouble,

07:26.720 --> 07:28.480
but we'll head northwest immediately

07:28.480 --> 07:29.680
to the Diancang Sect.

07:29.920 --> 07:30.680
-Yes!
-Okay.

07:45.940 --> 07:47.800
Are you ever going to stop eating?

07:53.720 --> 07:55.310
Where is the Hero Command Token?

07:55.310 --> 07:56.560
What's the rush?

08:01.720 --> 08:02.360
I have to say,

08:02.360 --> 08:03.960
your cooking is really good.

08:04.440 --> 08:05.700
Why aren't you eating?

08:09.310 --> 08:10.770
I thought you were clever,

08:11.720 --> 08:14.180
that there was
something special about you.

08:14.630 --> 08:17.290
But you can't even figure out
why I'm not eating.

08:17.550 --> 08:19.480
You're nothing but a useless fool.

08:20.790 --> 08:21.470
I know—

08:22.380 --> 08:23.640
you poisoned the meat.

08:30.720 --> 08:32.720
When I set Qu Hanshan up,

08:33.240 --> 08:35.270
I never expected to live in this world.

08:35.270 --> 08:37.000
I don't know what you were thinking.

08:37.000 --> 08:38.440
Maybe you hit your head?

08:39.360 --> 08:41.390
You brought me back here against my will.

08:41.390 --> 08:42.150
Listen,

08:42.630 --> 08:44.560
this poison means nothing to me.

08:46.670 --> 08:49.910
Do you know this poison
is called the Seven Perils Poison?

08:50.720 --> 08:51.960
If you try any tricks,

08:52.510 --> 08:54.040
I'll activate this poison,

08:54.150 --> 08:56.150
and you'll be in excruciating pain,

08:56.150 --> 08:58.750
as if countless ants are
gnawing at your veins.

09:13.720 --> 09:15.030
Actually, Old Madam Wu

09:15.870 --> 09:16.720
never told me

09:16.740 --> 09:18.550
where the Hero Command Token is.

09:19.080 --> 09:20.940
Before I parted with Old Madam Wu,

09:21.080 --> 09:23.210
she asked me to find Crazy Yan's family

09:24.150 --> 09:25.390
to fulfill her wish.

09:25.840 --> 09:26.840
That's all.

09:28.440 --> 09:29.840
That's all I know.

09:31.440 --> 09:33.170
You have to play it the hard way.

09:35.640 --> 09:36.920
Thank you for the meal.

10:29.760 --> 10:31.160
You summoned me, Master?

10:32.000 --> 10:33.260
Where is the Snake Duo?

10:34.270 --> 10:36.000
They've already gone to the Diancang Sect.

10:36.000 --> 10:36.840
Follow them.

10:37.550 --> 10:39.120
You want me to assist them

10:39.120 --> 10:40.920
in investigating the Marching…

10:46.760 --> 10:48.090
I want you to follow them

10:48.510 --> 10:51.310
so the Snake Duo
won't become Qu Hanshan's lackeys

10:51.550 --> 10:52.950
like Purple Phoenix did.

10:53.870 --> 10:54.360
Yes.

10:54.920 --> 10:57.660
I ordered them
to secretly look into the Marching Pill.

10:57.660 --> 10:59.060
If they step out of line,

11:00.240 --> 11:01.790
consider them traitors.

11:35.080 --> 11:37.540
You've been tortured
by ant venom for 12 hours.

11:37.540 --> 11:39.900
You're tougher than I expected.

11:59.480 --> 12:00.600
Liu Suifeng.

12:02.600 --> 12:04.270
If I ever get the chance,

12:07.150 --> 12:08.840
I will definitely kill you.

12:09.720 --> 12:11.580
You think you're capable of that?

12:13.840 --> 12:15.410
You've lost all your martial arts skills,

12:15.410 --> 12:17.120
and you're poisoned with ant venom.

12:17.120 --> 12:20.360
No one can save you now.

12:20.860 --> 12:21.660
Rest assured.

12:24.070 --> 12:25.150
I certainly will.

12:27.310 --> 12:28.220
Delusional.

12:29.150 --> 12:29.910
Liu Suifeng,

12:30.150 --> 12:31.030
come out here!

13:06.430 --> 13:09.670
I thought someone came to save that loser.

13:11.110 --> 13:12.770
Turns out it's the Sword King.

13:14.320 --> 13:15.840
Liu Suifeng.

13:17.700 --> 13:19.270
I know he's in your hands.

13:19.550 --> 13:20.630
So what if you know?

13:20.960 --> 13:22.020
Hand him over to me,

13:22.270 --> 13:24.320
and I'll let this go.

13:25.440 --> 13:26.360
Let this go?

13:27.360 --> 13:28.970
You mean the spies you sent?

13:29.910 --> 13:32.840
You turned Purple Phoenix
and Kang Chuyu against me.

13:32.960 --> 13:35.680
I haven't settled that score with you yet.

13:39.840 --> 13:40.910
Seems like you and I

13:40.910 --> 13:42.600
still can't see eye to eye.

13:43.630 --> 13:44.690
If that's the case,

13:45.360 --> 13:47.720
don't blame me for taking him by force.

14:21.960 --> 14:22.750
Qu Hanshan,

14:23.150 --> 14:25.320
Xiao Qiushui has what Chief wants.

14:25.780 --> 14:27.580
Are you trying to let him escape?

14:28.510 --> 14:29.360
Liu Suifeng,

14:30.080 --> 14:31.000
do you really think Xiao Qiushui

14:31.000 --> 14:33.400
would just sit in that room
waiting for you?

15:16.680 --> 15:19.050
Xilou, have some water.

15:22.510 --> 15:23.770
Any news from Qiushui?

15:29.360 --> 15:30.490
I'm not drinking it.

15:32.630 --> 15:33.440
You drink it.

15:35.230 --> 15:37.750
You haven't had a drop of water
for a full day and night.

15:37.750 --> 15:40.960
You can't survive on meditation alone.

15:41.910 --> 15:43.750
We're in our darkest hour now.

15:45.360 --> 15:48.840
Despite all the people fighting with us,

15:50.050 --> 15:53.680
we still ended up in this predicament.

15:55.270 --> 15:57.330
If reinforcements still don't come,

15:57.960 --> 15:58.870
I, Xiao Xilou,

16:01.030 --> 16:02.550
will risk my life

16:03.200 --> 16:06.790
to lead our disciples
out through the siege

16:06.790 --> 16:08.050
and fight to the death.

16:12.430 --> 16:13.150
Shan,

16:15.460 --> 16:19.430
I leave Junior Meng and the others to you.

16:22.550 --> 16:24.390
Don't talk like that.

16:25.600 --> 16:27.440
Qiushui has gone for help.

16:28.390 --> 16:29.390
He's so clever.

16:30.040 --> 16:31.370
He'll surely come back.

16:36.720 --> 16:38.550
Qiushui, our Qiushui,

16:40.840 --> 16:42.240
among all your siblings,

16:43.600 --> 16:45.000
you're the smartest.

16:49.670 --> 16:50.720
I know

16:53.000 --> 16:55.000
you won't let me down.

16:55.670 --> 16:56.270
You won't.

16:59.670 --> 17:01.730
Why didn't you praise him to his face?

17:02.160 --> 17:03.820
You were always scolding him.

17:09.640 --> 17:11.440
The children of the Xiao family—

17:13.510 --> 17:16.510
not just our 3 children,

17:17.160 --> 17:19.160
but all our disciples—

17:20.069 --> 17:22.069
they are the hope of the Xiao family.

17:24.069 --> 17:26.000
If we can keep them safe this time,

17:27.270 --> 17:31.880
the future of our Huanhua Sect is secure.

17:35.270 --> 17:37.880
Here, drink some water first.

17:41.640 --> 17:44.400
You drink it. Be good.

18:03.840 --> 18:04.920
It's so sweet.

18:06.120 --> 18:06.640
Here.

18:09.000 --> 18:10.060
Alright, alright.

18:10.100 --> 18:10.500
Drink.

18:17.560 --> 18:19.140
[Diancang Sect]

18:43.590 --> 18:45.850
Now that the Diancang Sect is dealt with,

18:45.960 --> 18:50.310
Liu Suifeng
will never be able to explain himself.

18:52.960 --> 18:55.020
I deliberately left a few survivors.

18:55.970 --> 18:57.370
Deputy Chief Liu's crime

18:57.750 --> 19:00.440
of slaughtering martial sects at will

19:02.160 --> 19:03.440
is now undeniable.

19:04.800 --> 19:07.400
Since ancient times,
humans have always been…

19:10.200 --> 19:12.480
the most vicious creatures.

19:25.640 --> 19:26.240
Snake.

19:29.330 --> 19:30.110
Snake.

19:32.310 --> 19:32.960
Snake.

19:33.550 --> 19:34.160
Snake.

19:34.920 --> 19:36.000
It was Liu Suifeng.

19:36.690 --> 19:37.750
The Diancang Sect…

19:41.490 --> 19:43.090
He's from the Diancang Sect.

19:54.110 --> 19:54.790
Yiren,

19:55.480 --> 19:57.310
this snake venom is extremely rare.

19:57.310 --> 19:59.770
It belongs to the Snake Duo
of the Power Gang.

20:00.070 --> 20:02.640
Looks like something's happened
to the Diancang Sect.

20:02.640 --> 20:03.840
Mr. Zuoqiu, Mr. Deng,

20:04.790 --> 20:07.000
the Diancang Sect is
about 10 li up the mountain.

20:07.000 --> 20:09.240
Please take the shortcut
to check things out.

20:09.240 --> 20:10.720
If there are any survivors,

20:10.720 --> 20:11.720
please help them.

20:12.000 --> 20:13.200
Alright, Mr. Xiao.

20:13.440 --> 20:14.400
You be careful too.

20:14.400 --> 20:15.000
Farewell.

20:15.040 --> 20:15.880
Let's join them.

20:15.880 --> 20:16.360
Okay.

20:23.850 --> 20:25.590
[Diancang Sect]

20:47.400 --> 20:48.930
It really was the Snake Duo.

21:02.480 --> 21:03.110
Watch out!

21:08.710 --> 21:09.350
Let me see.

21:17.030 --> 21:18.240
Everyone, be careful.

21:18.240 --> 21:19.900
The snake blood is poisonous.

21:30.350 --> 21:31.810
How dare you kill my snake?

21:32.610 --> 21:34.570
You really have a death wish.

21:41.830 --> 21:42.640
Power Gang?

21:44.350 --> 21:45.550
Since we've met here,

21:46.240 --> 21:47.700
I won't let you off easily!

21:47.720 --> 21:48.400
Shinian!

22:08.310 --> 22:09.270
Interesting.

22:09.830 --> 22:12.790
You actually think you can trap me
with a deceptive formation.

22:12.790 --> 22:13.720
Let's see

22:14.030 --> 22:15.490
if your formation can kill

22:15.720 --> 22:17.250
every last one of my snakes.

22:56.480 --> 22:57.070
Yiren,

22:57.920 --> 22:59.250
someone else is coming.

23:07.200 --> 23:08.820
[Zu Jindian, Fire King of the Power Gang]

23:26.400 --> 23:27.330
That's it for today.

23:27.330 --> 23:28.920
Who'd be out here
in the middle of nowhere?

23:28.920 --> 23:29.570
Don't give up yet.

23:29.570 --> 23:30.880
Didn't we find 4 yesterday?

23:30.070 --> 23:33.090
[The Four Thugs: Yuwen Dong,
Chang Wuqi, Meng Donglin, Jin Beiwang]

23:30.880 --> 23:32.140
T-That was yesterday.

23:33.600 --> 23:34.260
That thing.

23:35.310 --> 23:36.310
That white thing.

23:37.510 --> 23:38.310
It's a person.

23:38.510 --> 23:39.310
It's a person.

23:39.720 --> 23:41.720
Hurry! Let's go! We hit the jackpot!

23:42.480 --> 23:43.540
We hit the jackpot.

23:46.800 --> 23:48.260
He's dead. We'll get paid.

23:48.540 --> 23:49.540
Put him in the bag.

23:50.590 --> 23:52.190
Hurry! We're gonna get paid.

23:53.070 --> 23:54.270
He's alive, Beiwang.

23:54.270 --> 23:55.000
What did you do?

23:55.000 --> 23:55.640
He's alive.

23:55.640 --> 23:56.650
That's against our rule.

23:56.650 --> 23:58.380
We only make money off the dead.

23:59.580 --> 24:02.180
How did you touch him
and bring him back to life?

24:03.640 --> 24:05.110
If he's alive, we won't earn any coins.

24:05.110 --> 24:05.640
Exactly!

24:05.750 --> 24:06.300
I... I...

24:07.550 --> 24:09.390
Let's throw him back in the river
to feed the fish!

24:09.390 --> 24:10.250
Throw him back!

24:13.250 --> 24:14.050
Let go of me.

24:14.680 --> 24:15.940
My foot hurts too much.

24:16.640 --> 24:17.480
Misters,

24:17.890 --> 24:20.350
you went through all that trouble
to save me.

24:21.910 --> 24:24.630
Why are you trying to kill me again?

24:25.310 --> 24:26.440
-You…
-Cut the crap.

24:26.680 --> 24:29.200
We, the Four Thugs,
have only fished out dead bodies,

24:29.200 --> 24:30.160
never living people.

24:30.160 --> 24:30.920
That's right.

24:30.920 --> 24:33.320
We make a living
by retrieving dead bodies.

24:33.640 --> 24:35.200
You were dead
and suddenly came back to life.

24:35.200 --> 24:36.110
That's bad luck.

24:36.110 --> 24:37.170
Bad luck, bad luck!

24:41.110 --> 24:42.640
Stop wasting time with him.

24:42.680 --> 24:44.080
Before anyone finds out,

24:44.190 --> 24:46.450
throw him back in the river and drown him.

24:46.750 --> 24:48.820
He'll be dead in an hour.

24:49.440 --> 24:51.790
Then we'll fish him out and haul him back.

24:52.590 --> 24:54.070
Good idea!

24:54.400 --> 24:55.550
It hurts.

24:56.830 --> 24:57.590
Misters,

24:58.510 --> 24:59.510
can I say something?

24:59.510 --> 25:00.510
Just a quick word.

25:02.960 --> 25:03.960
Here's the thing.

25:04.950 --> 25:06.230
Think about it—

25:06.720 --> 25:08.250
making money off the living

25:08.640 --> 25:11.750
is faster than making money off the dead,

25:12.340 --> 25:13.000
right?

25:15.640 --> 25:16.510
Impossible.

25:17.000 --> 25:17.730
Impossible.

25:18.510 --> 25:19.840
The authorities told us

25:19.920 --> 25:23.280
that we get 500 coins for each body.

25:23.310 --> 25:25.400
N-No. Isn't it 100…

25:28.000 --> 25:30.160
If he's alive, we won't get a reward.

25:30.960 --> 25:31.960
Right. No reward.

25:36.110 --> 25:36.970
How about this?

25:37.200 --> 25:38.000
I'll give you

25:39.030 --> 25:39.690
the reward.

25:39.830 --> 25:40.960
Who do you think you are?

25:40.960 --> 25:41.510
Exactly!

25:41.640 --> 25:42.440
Why should we trust you?

25:42.440 --> 25:43.480
Yeah. Why should we believe you?

25:43.480 --> 25:43.790
Yes.

25:43.830 --> 25:45.690
Exactly. Why should we trust you?

25:47.070 --> 25:50.920
I think the Huanhua Sect's villa
isn't far from here.

25:51.310 --> 25:52.270
Misters,

25:52.830 --> 25:55.510
just come with me and you'll see.

25:56.160 --> 25:57.400
Huan... Huan...

25:57.790 --> 25:58.680
Huanhua Sect?

25:59.270 --> 26:00.930
The Huanhua Sect of Jinzhong?

26:02.400 --> 26:03.720
Judging by his age,

26:04.630 --> 26:08.630
could he be the third son
of the Xiao family, Xiao Qiushui?

26:10.190 --> 26:10.990
Xiao Qiushui?

26:11.490 --> 26:14.530
Xiao Qiushui!

26:15.420 --> 26:15.830
I…

26:20.240 --> 26:21.200
Xiao Qiushui?

26:21.920 --> 26:23.520
You've got the wrong person.

26:23.590 --> 26:24.790
I'm not Xiao Qiushui.

26:25.070 --> 26:27.920
Xiao Qiushui's men
killed the Three Heroes.

26:27.920 --> 26:28.350
Right.

26:28.480 --> 26:29.550
He is Xiao Qiushui.

26:29.550 --> 26:30.270
Yes, that's him.

26:30.270 --> 26:30.920
That's him.

26:30.920 --> 26:32.550
-It's him!
-His men killed the Three Heroes.

26:32.550 --> 26:33.920
We're their good friends.

26:33.920 --> 26:34.830
The one who killed them

26:34.830 --> 26:35.960
is our enemy.

26:35.960 --> 26:37.240
-Right.
-Kill him!

26:37.240 --> 26:37.830
Kill him!

26:38.980 --> 26:39.830
Wait, wait.

26:39.880 --> 26:40.550
Misters,

26:41.200 --> 26:42.510
what are you talking about?

26:42.510 --> 26:44.110
I'm really not Xiao Qiushui.

26:44.310 --> 26:45.550
How could I possibly have killed

26:45.550 --> 26:46.480
your friends?

26:46.550 --> 26:48.280
I don't even know martial arts.

26:49.440 --> 26:50.960
He said he didn't kill them.

26:50.960 --> 26:52.550
Then he's not Xiao Qiushui.

26:53.040 --> 26:53.810
Hold on.

26:53.840 --> 26:55.720
Then why is he taking us
to the Huanhua Sect?

26:55.720 --> 26:57.240
He's also offered us a reward.

26:57.240 --> 26:58.030
Y-Yeah.

26:58.510 --> 26:59.110
It's him!

26:59.310 --> 26:59.960
Oh no.

27:00.070 --> 27:02.030
The Three Heroes of Long River are
characters in the original novel.

27:02.030 --> 27:03.270
At the beginning of the story,

27:03.270 --> 27:04.640
they were killed by Xiao Qiushui.

27:04.640 --> 27:06.170
According to the timeline,

27:07.030 --> 27:08.750
I hadn't come into this world

27:08.750 --> 27:10.070
to become Xiao Qiushui then.

27:10.070 --> 27:11.200
-It's him!
-Kill him!

27:11.200 --> 27:11.920
Kill him first!

27:11.920 --> 27:13.240
Right, kill him first!

27:14.750 --> 27:15.720
If we kill him

27:15.720 --> 27:16.720
after saving him,

27:16.880 --> 27:18.620
are we saving him or killing him?

27:18.620 --> 27:20.140
Cut the crap, Donglin.

27:22.310 --> 27:23.840
I remember now! I remember!

27:23.920 --> 27:25.250
W-What did you just say?

27:25.750 --> 27:26.510
The Three…

27:27.680 --> 27:28.790
Three Heroes!

27:28.790 --> 27:30.450
Yes, right, the Three Heroes.

27:30.550 --> 27:31.480
The Three Heroes

27:32.030 --> 27:33.760
were all great at martial arts.

27:33.920 --> 27:35.680
My martial arts skills are ordinary.

27:35.680 --> 27:36.310
So tell me,

27:36.310 --> 27:38.440
how could I possibly have killed them?

27:40.030 --> 27:41.290
I-I don't believe you.

27:41.550 --> 27:42.790
-Me neither.
-We don't believe you.

27:42.790 --> 27:43.650
Think about it,

27:43.680 --> 27:45.070
how many people are the Three Heroes?

27:45.070 --> 27:46.200
T-Three.

27:46.350 --> 27:47.440
Three against 1—

27:47.680 --> 27:49.510
how could they possibly have lost to me?

27:49.510 --> 27:50.240
Besides,

27:50.350 --> 27:51.440
how many of you are there?

27:51.440 --> 27:52.310
Four.

27:52.880 --> 27:54.350
More people means more strength.

27:54.350 --> 27:55.350
If you don't stick together,

27:55.350 --> 27:56.920
how can you make a living as a team?

27:56.920 --> 27:57.640
Am I right?

27:59.160 --> 28:00.070
-That makes sense.
-That makes sense.

28:00.070 --> 28:00.880
No, it doesn't!

28:00.880 --> 28:01.590
Why not?

28:01.680 --> 28:03.940
Could the 4 of us
defeat the Three Heroes?

28:04.000 --> 28:06.000
If we couldn't defeat the Three Heroes,

28:06.000 --> 28:07.440
then we definitely can't defeat him.

28:07.440 --> 28:08.790
So which is better,

28:08.790 --> 28:09.510
more people or fewer people?

28:09.510 --> 28:10.840
More people, of course!

28:12.680 --> 28:13.550
Donglin…

28:16.790 --> 28:17.960
Kill him first!

28:18.590 --> 28:19.680
I'm done talking to you.

28:19.680 --> 28:21.830
This matter is really too complicated.

28:21.830 --> 28:23.090
Let me explain slowly.

28:23.200 --> 28:24.310
When the Three Heroes died,

28:24.310 --> 28:25.960
I wasn't even in this world,

28:25.960 --> 28:27.640
and I wasn't Xiao Qiushui at all.

28:27.640 --> 28:29.440
Why do you have to kill me?

28:29.550 --> 28:30.680
I just don't understand

28:30.680 --> 28:32.010
why you're so stubborn.

28:32.470 --> 28:32.880
No.

28:33.270 --> 28:34.160
It was a year ago.

28:34.160 --> 28:35.880
The Three Heroes died 1 year ago.

28:35.880 --> 28:37.880
He said he wasn't in this world then.

28:38.030 --> 28:39.830
Does he look like he's 1 year old?

28:42.680 --> 28:44.080
Am I cursed or something?

28:45.250 --> 28:46.780
Stop wasting time with him.

28:46.960 --> 28:48.150
If we keep listening to him,

28:48.150 --> 28:49.160
we'll all be fooled.

28:49.160 --> 28:50.420
Yes! He'll fool us all!

28:50.720 --> 28:51.810
-Beiwang.
-Beiwang.

28:51.810 --> 28:53.350
-Kill him first.
-Kill him first.

28:53.350 --> 28:53.750
Do it.

28:54.860 --> 28:55.710
What are you going to do?

28:55.710 --> 28:56.350
Stay back.

29:01.990 --> 29:03.270
-Kill him!
-Wait.

29:03.950 --> 29:06.400
The Three Heroes were killed
by Xiao Qiushui's men:

29:06.400 --> 29:09.070
one by saber, one by sword,
and one by hidden weapons.

29:09.070 --> 29:10.440
How should we kill him

29:10.790 --> 29:12.320
to avenge the Three Heroes?

29:13.110 --> 29:14.000
Y-You're so annoying.

29:14.000 --> 29:15.260
How should we kill him?

29:16.160 --> 29:17.920
He has 2 hands and 2 feet.

29:18.270 --> 29:19.270
Chop them all off.

29:19.480 --> 29:21.550
We each get one

29:21.570 --> 29:22.200
for revenge.

29:22.200 --> 29:23.000
Chop them off.

29:27.880 --> 29:28.810
Don't touch him.

30:08.640 --> 30:09.200
Yiren!

30:14.400 --> 30:15.400
Xueyu, watch out!

30:33.640 --> 30:35.240
Master really foresaw this.

30:35.680 --> 30:37.050
The Snake Duo not only betrayed him

30:37.050 --> 30:39.200
but also colluded with Zu Jindian,
the Fire King.

30:39.200 --> 30:42.260
Looks like they're determined
to side with Qu Hanshan.

30:47.830 --> 30:48.510
Xueyu!

30:57.920 --> 30:58.400
Yiren!

30:58.790 --> 30:59.350
Retreat!

30:59.550 --> 31:00.410
I'll cover you.

31:00.830 --> 31:01.550
Shinian!

31:02.110 --> 31:02.920
Protect Yiren!

31:02.920 --> 31:04.000
Young Master Yiren,

31:04.000 --> 31:04.960
go!

31:05.310 --> 31:05.840
Shinian!

31:21.960 --> 31:22.590
Go, Yiren!

31:22.880 --> 31:23.440
Young Master Yiren, go!

31:23.440 --> 31:23.920
Go!

31:26.830 --> 31:28.030
Come at me if you dare!

31:45.920 --> 31:46.650
Red Phoenix,

31:47.400 --> 31:49.550
why are you
turning against your own people?

31:49.550 --> 31:52.070
Master sent you
to investigate the Diancang Sect,

31:52.070 --> 31:54.160
yet you wiped it out on your own.

31:55.640 --> 31:57.160
You've even colluded with the Sword King.

31:57.160 --> 31:58.680
Of course I have to kill you.

31:58.680 --> 31:59.960
If that's the case,

32:00.440 --> 32:02.270
I won't hold back anymore!

32:11.070 --> 32:14.110
Xiao Qiushui… He's still alive.

32:19.200 --> 32:21.600
Young Master Yiren,
we should be safe here.

32:26.880 --> 32:30.030
I spent years training Shinian.

32:30.920 --> 32:33.850
They've sacrificed themselves
for the Xiao family,

32:34.200 --> 32:36.530
and I couldn't even protect their bodies.

32:37.550 --> 32:40.200
The Xiao family helped a lot of people,

32:40.350 --> 32:42.150
but now we've landed in hot water

32:42.880 --> 32:44.440
and ended up like this.

32:46.750 --> 32:47.640
Why?

32:49.790 --> 32:50.880
Why?

32:52.240 --> 32:53.880
We've already lost Qiushui.

32:55.270 --> 32:58.480
Is the Xiao family destined to fall?

33:04.130 --> 33:04.790
Yiren.

33:10.270 --> 33:11.550
What did you just say?

33:16.380 --> 33:17.620
Qiushui is dead?

33:25.170 --> 33:26.280
Qiushui…

33:31.270 --> 33:33.010
Wasn't he recovering at the branch?

33:33.010 --> 33:35.320
♪ Huanhua flower withers ♪

33:34.350 --> 33:35.920
How could Qiushui be dead?

33:35.340 --> 33:40.050
♪ What's the meaning of my life? ♪

33:40.310 --> 33:42.660
♪ The wind blows ♪

33:40.790 --> 33:42.390
I must have misheard, right?

33:42.690 --> 33:47.130
♪ Like a farewell song ♪

33:44.590 --> 33:45.640
I misheard,

33:47.000 --> 33:47.830
didn't I, Yiren?

33:47.730 --> 33:50.180
♪ Who accompanies when the qin breaks? ♪

33:50.200 --> 33:52.670
♪ How much sadness is there? ♪

33:52.690 --> 33:55.800
♪ Gazing at the moon
at the end of the world ♪

33:54.400 --> 33:54.920
Yiren,

33:56.490 --> 34:03.770
♪ Tears fall unrestrained;
the leaves are unswayed ♪

33:57.230 --> 33:58.690
what happened to Qiushui?

34:02.030 --> 34:03.490
What happened to Qiushui?

34:03.550 --> 34:04.400
Xueyu,

34:06.020 --> 34:07.320
Qiushui is dead.

34:06.710 --> 34:08.699
♪ The moon is reflected in the water ♪

34:08.719 --> 34:12.780
♪ Not even a ripple is left behind ♪

34:10.440 --> 34:11.710
He's dead!

34:12.960 --> 34:13.690
Impossible.

34:14.440 --> 34:17.110
♪ The broken sword can't be pulled out ♪

34:17.130 --> 34:20.600
♪ It's a heartbreaking punishment ♪

34:21.190 --> 34:23.750
♪ Huanhua flower withers ♪

34:23.770 --> 34:28.020
♪ What's the meaning of my life? ♪

34:28.489 --> 34:30.940
♪ The wind blows ♪

34:30.960 --> 34:35.880
♪ Like a farewell song ♪

34:36.000 --> 34:38.239
♪ Who accompanies when the qin breaks? ♪

34:37.440 --> 34:39.030
Why didn't you tell me?

34:38.409 --> 34:41.030
♪ How much sadness is there? ♪

34:40.280 --> 34:40.960
Xueyu.

34:41.050 --> 34:44.270
♪ Gazing at the moon
at the end of the world ♪

34:42.230 --> 34:44.150
We didn't mean to hide it from you.

34:44.810 --> 34:51.150
♪ Tears fall unrestrained;
the leaves are unswayed ♪

34:45.280 --> 34:46.110
Qiushui...

34:48.000 --> 34:50.260
He didn't want us to be deceived anymore,

34:50.670 --> 34:52.270
so he did everything he could

34:53.199 --> 34:55.679
to expose the Sword King.

34:54.840 --> 34:57.070
♪ Who accompanies when the qin breaks? ♪

34:56.000 --> 34:56.840
Until the end,

34:57.240 --> 34:59.860
♪ How much sadness is there? ♪

34:57.480 --> 34:59.000
Qiushui kept telling us

34:59.360 --> 35:01.000
to return to the Sword Manor
as soon as possible.

34:59.890 --> 35:03.100
♪ Gazing at the moon
at the end of the world ♪

35:01.670 --> 35:03.360
It was his last wish.

35:03.640 --> 35:09.990
♪ Tears fall unrestrained;
the leaves are unswayed ♪

35:06.230 --> 35:06.920
Yiren,

35:08.110 --> 35:10.320
we can't let Qiushui die in vain.

35:10.850 --> 35:18.530
♪ As the flowers fall,
my heart falls with them ♪

35:11.230 --> 35:11.880
Now,

35:13.880 --> 35:16.280
our parents' lives are
hanging by a thread.

35:16.790 --> 35:18.450
Kaiyan got separated from us.

35:21.320 --> 35:22.760
It's up to us now

35:22.760 --> 35:24.090
to save the Xiao family.

35:26.550 --> 35:28.410
You must pull yourself together.

36:18.960 --> 36:19.710
It hurts.

36:20.160 --> 36:21.480
-Are you okay?
-It hurts.

36:21.480 --> 36:23.030
Liu Suifeng!

36:23.360 --> 36:24.440
Damn you, Liu Suifeng.

36:24.440 --> 36:25.030
Listen,

36:25.230 --> 36:26.890
we work for Zhu the Great King.

36:27.320 --> 36:27.710
Yeah.

36:27.710 --> 36:29.110
Hurt us again, and we'll…

36:42.710 --> 36:43.770
Stop playing dead.

36:44.050 --> 36:46.250
My poison only attacks your meridians.

36:46.800 --> 36:48.190
You can still talk.

36:57.510 --> 36:58.470
You beast!

36:59.590 --> 37:00.990
You might as well kill me.

37:02.760 --> 37:03.560
That's right.

37:04.880 --> 37:05.510
Fine.

37:06.440 --> 37:08.970
I'll give you
until 3 incense sticks burn out.

37:09.110 --> 37:10.360
Once they do,

37:11.320 --> 37:13.190
I'll break their arms and legs.

37:14.750 --> 37:15.410
Wait, wait!

37:15.800 --> 37:16.800
There are 4 of us.

37:16.820 --> 37:17.880
If you light 3 incense sticks,

37:17.880 --> 37:19.480
that will leave 1 person out.

37:19.550 --> 37:20.480
Right, exactly.

37:26.850 --> 37:27.510
Donglin.

37:27.960 --> 37:28.760
Donglin, Donglin.

37:28.760 --> 37:29.630
It hurts!

37:29.630 --> 37:30.150
You...

37:30.490 --> 37:30.920
I...

37:31.360 --> 37:32.090
Liu Suifeng!

37:34.760 --> 37:36.160
Now the numbers match up.

37:37.800 --> 37:39.840
Why don't you just break his limbs

37:39.840 --> 37:41.070
and force him to talk?

37:41.070 --> 37:42.280
Yeah, break his limbs.

37:42.280 --> 37:43.080
That's right.

37:44.280 --> 37:46.680
These 4 people
have nothing to do with this.

37:48.070 --> 37:49.130
It's so despicable

37:49.360 --> 37:50.670
of you to do this.

37:56.550 --> 37:57.230
Mr. Xiao,

37:58.000 --> 38:00.460
if you can't bear
to see these people suffer,

38:00.590 --> 38:01.790
then think carefully

38:02.710 --> 38:04.840
about where the Hero Command Token is.

38:43.030 --> 38:44.240
My kneecap!

38:54.230 --> 38:55.130
Stop it.

38:55.680 --> 38:56.960
-Stop it!
-Just tell him!

38:56.960 --> 38:58.480
Yeah, tell him.

38:58.760 --> 38:59.630
My leg!

38:59.890 --> 39:01.160
Just tell him!

39:01.190 --> 39:02.670
-My leg!
-Hurry up!

39:04.190 --> 39:04.710
Master.

39:17.970 --> 39:19.500
You guessed right, Master.

39:19.800 --> 39:21.150
The Snake Duo wiped out the Diancang Sect

39:21.150 --> 39:22.350
and framed you for it.

39:23.000 --> 39:26.030
They also conspired with the Fire King,
who works for the Sword King.

39:26.030 --> 39:27.320
Xiao Yiren, the eldest son
of the Xiao family,

39:27.320 --> 39:28.840
was rushing back to the Sword Manor
with Shinian

39:28.840 --> 39:30.760
and encountered
the Snake Duo and Fire King.

39:30.760 --> 39:31.760
During the fight,

39:32.000 --> 39:33.480
2 of their prized Shinian

39:33.800 --> 39:34.960
were killed.

39:35.360 --> 39:37.030
What about those traitors, the Snake Duo?

39:37.030 --> 39:38.190
I fought 3 of them alone

39:38.190 --> 39:39.450
and killed 1 of the duo.

39:40.230 --> 39:42.290
But I didn't let them get away easily.

39:44.280 --> 39:45.680
I took Shinian's tokens.

39:45.800 --> 39:47.400
They can help you force Xiao Qiushui

39:47.400 --> 39:49.270
to reveal where the Hero Command Token is.

39:49.270 --> 39:50.800
That's an unexpected gain.

39:52.320 --> 39:52.920
You may go.

39:53.880 --> 39:54.360
Yes.

40:04.070 --> 40:07.000
-Damn you, Liu Suifeng!
-Xiao Qiushui, you bastard!

40:08.510 --> 40:09.420
Xiao Qiushui!

40:09.960 --> 40:11.150
Xiao Qiushui!

40:13.190 --> 40:14.280
What should we do now?

40:14.280 --> 40:15.680
Look at our broken limbs.

40:17.110 --> 40:19.150
We Four Thugs

40:19.150 --> 40:21.280
are each hobbling on one leg now.

40:22.840 --> 40:23.780
It's all your fault!

40:23.780 --> 40:25.320
Yes! It's all your fault.

40:26.710 --> 40:27.440
Bro,

40:27.960 --> 40:29.960
could you get your hand off my thigh?

40:32.150 --> 40:34.300
You've got a mouth
harder to crack than a stone.

40:34.300 --> 40:35.230
-So tight-lipped.
-Yeah.

40:35.230 --> 40:35.960
E-Exactly!

40:36.230 --> 40:37.440
Just say it.

40:37.440 --> 40:39.000
Tell me where the token is.

40:39.020 --> 40:41.550
Otherwise, when Liu Suifeng lights
3 more incense sticks,

40:41.550 --> 40:43.750
it'll be our heads that get chopped off.

40:44.150 --> 40:45.510
Hurry up and tell me where it is.

40:45.510 --> 40:46.440
Where's the token?

40:46.440 --> 40:47.070
Where's the token?

40:47.070 --> 40:47.590
Wait.

40:47.920 --> 40:48.880
Wait.

40:48.900 --> 40:50.980
Guys, I'll talk. I'll talk.

40:51.550 --> 40:52.110
Guys,

40:52.110 --> 40:54.640
I'm truly sorry
for getting you all involved.

40:54.800 --> 40:55.590
Guys,

40:55.590 --> 40:56.290
actually,

40:56.440 --> 40:59.000
I really don't know
where the Hero Command Token is.

40:59.000 --> 41:00.330
He says he doesn't know.

41:00.920 --> 41:02.440
He says
he doesn't have the Hero Command Token.

41:02.440 --> 41:03.170
If you ask me,

41:03.550 --> 41:05.210
we should break his limbs too.

41:05.440 --> 41:06.360
Even if he doesn't confess,

41:06.360 --> 41:07.610
at least it'll feel fair.

41:07.610 --> 41:08.440
Make it fair.

41:08.630 --> 41:09.040
Right.

41:09.230 --> 41:11.070
-I'll hit him here.
-Right, right.

41:11.070 --> 41:11.920
I'll hit him here.

41:11.920 --> 41:12.580
Wait, wait.

41:12.670 --> 41:13.470
I'll tell you!

41:13.950 --> 41:15.150
What is there to tell?

41:15.160 --> 41:16.440
Just listen to me for a second.

41:16.440 --> 41:17.920
You're driving me crazy with your noise!

41:17.920 --> 41:18.880
Let me ask you this:

41:18.880 --> 41:20.410
what does Liu Suifeng want?

41:20.550 --> 41:22.110
He wants the Hero Command Token.

41:22.110 --> 41:23.150
I've told you 10,000 times

41:23.150 --> 41:24.440
I don't have the Hero Command Token!

41:24.440 --> 41:24.960
No way!

41:25.000 --> 41:26.440
So what does he want?

41:26.440 --> 41:27.280
I don't have the token!

41:27.280 --> 41:28.840
Without it, he'll kill us all.

41:28.840 --> 41:29.800
So I'm asking you:

41:29.800 --> 41:30.710
what should we do now?

41:30.710 --> 41:31.610
Stick together.

41:31.610 --> 41:33.780
Figure out a way to break free

41:34.110 --> 41:34.840
and kill him.

41:37.030 --> 41:37.630
Right!

41:37.630 --> 41:38.710
Wuqi, he's right!

41:38.800 --> 41:39.920
Not at all.

41:40.190 --> 41:41.440
-Right my ass!
-Wrong!

41:41.440 --> 41:41.920
Wrong!

41:42.710 --> 41:43.110
Wrong!

41:43.110 --> 41:44.480
We'll die anyway.

41:44.920 --> 41:47.400
I might as well die alongside you!

41:47.400 --> 41:48.860
Stop pulling me, will you?

41:49.740 --> 41:51.260
I've had enough of this.

41:58.120 --> 41:58.920
Liu Suifeng!

42:01.040 --> 42:01.730
Be careful.

42:03.110 --> 42:05.630
His life is worth more than all of yours.

42:09.950 --> 42:11.150
You may not care about

42:11.710 --> 42:12.980
these 4 men's lives.

42:14.670 --> 42:16.270
But what about these people?

42:46.630 --> 42:48.480
Where did you get these tokens?

42:50.590 --> 42:52.320
What have you done to my family?

42:54.190 --> 42:55.920
What I've done doesn't matter.

42:56.670 --> 42:58.070
Think about what you should do.
